<item><title>Cameroon ships 17 tons of coffee to China duty-free</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-ships-17-tons-of-coffee-to-china-duty-free-ac9fbb/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-ships-17-tons-of-coffee-to-china-duty-free-ac9fbb/</guid><category>Cameroon</category><description>A first shipment of 17 metric tons of Cameroonian coffee is reportedly on its way to China under a zero-tariff deal that took effect on May 1, 2026.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:53:02 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" length="34085" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
