<item><title>Cameroon imports jump 22.8% in first quarter despite curbs</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-imports-jump-22-8-in-first-quarter-despite-curbs-425468/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-imports-jump-22-8-in-first-quarter-despite-curbs-425468/</guid><category>Cameroon</category><description>Goods imports rose 25.8% while exports grew only 3.8%, pushing the trade deficit to 5.7% of GDP, the National Institute of Statistics said.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:01:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-imports-jump-22-8-in-first-quarter-despite-curbs-425468/share.jpg" length="40890" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-imports-jump-22-8-in-first-quarter-despite-curbs-425468/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
